  15:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/max_torque_per_ampere.c **** *            of the Maximum Torque Per Ampere (MTPA) Control component of the Stellar Motor Control
  16:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/max_torque_per_ampere.c **** *
  17:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/max_torque_per_ampere.c **** *   @details This file provides firmware functions that implement the features
  18:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/max_torque_per_ampere.c **** *            of the Maximum Torque Per Ampere (MTPA) Control component of the Stellar Motor Control
  19:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/max_torque_per_ampere.c **** *
  20:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/max_torque_per_ampere.c **** *            - Initialize the parameter for  MTPA
  21:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/max_torque_per_ampere.c **** *            - Calculate and output id and iq reference based on torque input
  22:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/max_torque_per_ampere.c **** *            - Calculate and output id based on iq input
  23:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/max_torque_per_ampere.c ****  */
